  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Scout All Terrain Hybrid Tactical Shoe is engineered to keep you on your feet and moving while offering unbeatable comfort and durability in any environment. The 4 inch height provides extreme flexibility during quick and rapid movements, allowing you instantly turn and pivot. Just like our other Frontline boots, the Scout is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, the Scout features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133417",
  "description": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Scout All Terrain Hybrid Tactical Shoe is engineered to keep you on your feet and moving while offering unbeatable comfort and durability in any environment. The 4 inch height provides extreme flexibility during quick and rapid movements, allowing you instantly turn and pivot. Just like our other Frontline boots, the Scout is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, the Scout features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction. H2O Lock Weather Protection System: Featuring a premium waterproof leather and polyester upper, these tactical hiking shoes ensure your feet stay dry, no matter the environment. The boot shoe utilizes a waterproof internal lining for added protection, with a moisture wicking mesh liner underneath for breathability while keeping water out. The gusseted tongue helps shield your foot from dirt and debris. Comfort Lock Fatigue Defense System: The molded EVA footbed and EVA midsole help absorb shock, cushioning your feet from impact while providing all-day comfort. These breathable all terrain tactical shoes feature a lightweight flexible bonded construction and a nylon shank for added support and stability. Ground Lock Terrain Endurance System: These low-profile tactical shoes come equipped with a non-slip and oil-resistant outsole with multidirectional grip lugs, allowing you to maintain your footing with enhanced grip and traction. The high abrasion rubber toe cap &amp; heel counter provide an additional layer of protection, including when taking off the shoe by pushing down on the ankle. The non-marking outsole prevents leaving scuff marks on flooring. Ready at a Moment&rsquo;s Notice: From field operations to outdoor excursions, these ruggedly durable boots are great for hikers, hunters, military personnel, tactical enthusiasts, everyday wear, and more. On The Frontlines: Utilizing the Lock System, each boot and shoe within Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Footwear Series is designed to tackle any job, all day, every day.</p>",
